Blinkered word list for 日本語 (ja)
SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0

This file is generated. It is not a copy of any dictionary. It is the list of words that
appear in a frequency-ordered corpus of ja AND are accepted by every validator
below, filtered to what the game can deal as tiles. Neither input is redistributed here.
Rebuild it with `pnpm dictionary build --language=ja`.

Distributed under CC-BY-SA-4.0, which is the most restrictive of the terms below. See
PROVENANCE.md for what was relied on and why.

